---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const stories=[
 {href:'/cases/consilium-medicum/google-ads',tag:'GOOGLE ADS',metric:'3,356',unit:'tracked conversions',title:'Capture existing patient demand.',copy:'The core performance story: Google Search at €3.25 average cost per conversion.'},
 {href:'/cases/consilium-medicum/medical-google-ads',tag:'MEDICAL GOOGLE ADS',metric:'POLICY',unit:'restrictions + blocks',title:'Keep acquisition running when Google says no.',copy:'The operational side of healthcare advertising: approvals, limitations, landing pages and recovery.'},
 {href:'/cases/consilium-medicum/meta-ads',tag:'META ADS',metric:'1,484',unit:'enquiries · 2025',title:'Create another entry point for patients.',copy:'A full year of Meta acquisition at a weighted €4.22 per enquiry.'},
 {href:'/cases/consilium-medicum/seo',tag:'SEO / ORGANIC',metric:'2,011',unit:'organic enquiries · 2025',title:'Own part of the search demand.',copy:'Service pages and medical content turned organic visibility into measurable enquiries.'}
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Consilium Medicum case library | RM CREATIVES" description="Four acquisition stories from RM CREATIVES' completed partnership with Consilium Medicum: Google Ads, medical advertising restrictions, Meta Ads and SEO.">
<main><section class="hero shell"><div class="crumb eyebrow"><a href="/cases">CASES</a><span> / CONSILIUM MEDICUM</span></div><div class="hero-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">MEDICAL CLINIC / COMPLETED PARTNERSHIP</span><h1>One clinic.<br/><em>Four acquisition stories.</em></h1></div><div><p>Consilium Medicum was a long-term RM project that ended in 2026. Instead of compressing years of work into one logo card, we show the individual problems we solved across paid search, healthcare ad restrictions, Meta and organic search.</p><span class="eyebrow">PROJECT ENDED / 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="stories shell">{stories.map((s,i)=><a class:list={['story',i===0&&'featured']} href={s.href}><div class="top"><span class="eyebrow">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} / {s.tag}</span><b>OPEN CASE ↗</b></div><div class="metric"><strong>{s.metric}</strong><small>{s.unit}</small></div><div class="copy"><h2>{s.title}</h2><p>{s.copy}</p></div></a>)}</section>
<section class="proof dark"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">PROJECT DATA</span><h2>Different channels.<br/>Same business objective.</h2><div class="flow"><span>GOOGLE SEARCH</span><b>+</b><span>META</span><b>+</b><span>ORGANIC</span><b>→</b><span>PATIENT ENQUIRIES</span></div><p>Where CRM-to-visit attribution was not available, we do not convert enquiries into invented patient or revenue figures. Each case states exactly what was measured.</p></div></section>
</main></BaseLayout>
<style>.hero{padding:38px 0 110px}.crumb{padding-bottom:16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.45fr .55fr;gap:80px;padding:90px 0 20px;align-items:end}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(62px,8vw,126px);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:18px 0}.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)}.hero-grid p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted)}.stories{padding-bottom:140px}.story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.6fr .8fr 1fr;gap:40px;min-height:420px;padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:inherit}.story:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.top{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.top b{font:10px monospace}.metric{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}.metric strong{font-size:clamp(60px,8vw,120px);letter-spacing:-.075em;line-height:.85}.metric small{font:10px monospace;color:var(--muted);margin-top:15px}.copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end}.copy h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,58px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:0 0 22px}.copy p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted);max-width:450px}.story.featured .metric strong{color:var(--accent)}.proof{padding:130px 0}.proof h2{font-size:clamp(52px,7vw,100px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.065em}.proof p{max-width:650px;color:#888;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:50px}.flow{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;font:10px monospace}.flow span{border:1px solid #444;padding:12px}@media(max-width:800px){.hero-grid,.story{grid-template-columns:1fr}.story{min-height:0;padding:35px 0}.top{gap:30px}.metric{padding:35px 0}.stories{padding-bottom:90px}.proof{padding:90px 0}}</style>